  "name": "Check the email of every form signup and add valid ones to a nurture campaign",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Check the email of every form signup and add valid ones to a nurture campaign\n\n### How it works\nKeep fake and mistyped addresses out of your campaigns. The n8n form asks for first name, last name, work email and company. Argorant checks the email right away. A valid address joins your nurture campaign with the name and company as variables, and the person sees a thank you page. Any other result (invalid, risky, catch-all or unknown) shows a friendly page asking for a work email, and nothing is added.\n\nCosts: half a credit per fresh check; addresses checked recently are free. Adding to the campaign is free.\n\n### Setup\n1. Install the community node **n8n-nodes-argorant** (tested with 0.3.0 on n8n 2.46.6): Settings > Community nodes > Install. Guide: https://github.com/argorant/n8n-nodes-argorant\n2. Add an **Argorant API** credential with a key from Argorant (Settings, API keys).\n3. Pick the nurture campaign in **Add to nurture campaign**.\n4. Activate the workflow and share the production URL of **Signup form**.\n\n### Customization\nEdit the form fields and the texts of the two end pages. Business emails only can be switched on in the add options.",
        "height": 575,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "619205d3-6fa8-4b8f-9a28-da6a6ad99587",
      "name": "Overview",
